  "overview": {
    "text": {
      "en": "Dubai is more useful as two focused outings than a list of distant landmarks: creekside heritage in Bur Dubai and the modern skyline around Downtown. Decide which paid interiors you want before choosing a base and calculating local journeys."
    },
